# Cloudflare Pages response headers (owner, 2026-11-21; T12).
# Cross-origin isolation enables multi-threaded WebAssembly (SharedArrayBuffer) for the
# WASM backend; every asset is same-origin (models come from /models/* on this origin),
# so require-corp blocks nothing the app needs. Function responses (/models/*) set their
# own headers in functions/models/[[path]].ts.
/*
  Cross-Origin-Opener-Policy: same-origin
  Cross-Origin-Embedder-Policy: require-corp
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  Referrer-Policy: no-referrer

# The service worker must be re-checked on every visit so updates are found (T69).
/sw.js
  Cache-Control: no-cache
